                        <asset-clip ref="r7" name="B3 octaves are not that simple" start="0s" audioRole="effects" offset="1151/30s" duration="56/5s">
                            <note>narration: Now you obviously would think why didn't you apply this to octaves? But the thing is when you're tuning octaves it's not as simple as just making your finger smaller.  |  from C3/C3.afc  |  words 54–83</note>
                            <adjust-volume amount="-60dB"/>
                            <title ref="r14" name="B3.L2 — octaves: don't just squeeze" start="3600s" offset="53/6s" duration="28/15s" lane="1">
