                        </asset-clip>
                        <asset-clip ref="r8" name="B4 the first finger travels further" start="0s" audioRole="effects" offset="1487/30s" duration="64/5s">
                            <note>narration: the interval that we go from just shifting maybe one whole step in an octave our first finger is actually traveling more distance than our fourth finger in this case.  |  from C4/C4.bdb  |  words 84–113</note>
                            <adjust-volume amount="-60dB"/>
                            <video ref="r16" name="B4.L2 — An octave shape on the D and A strings before and after an upward whole-step shift; first-finger travel is longer than fourth-finger travel." start="0s" offset="23/10s" duration="4s" lane="1"/>
                            <title ref="r14" name="B4.L3 — the first finger travels further" start="3600s" offset="136/15s" duration="11/5s" lane="2">
